c, Naomi Osaka and Venus Williams are among those in action on the first day of the tournament.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/07/01/sports/wimbledon-what-to-watch.html', 'snippet': 'Novak Djokovic, Naomi Osaka and Venus Williams are among those in action on the first day of the tournament.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Djokovic, the defending men’s singles champion, will open play on Centre Court at 8 a.m. Eastern. Djokovic, the No. 1 seed, has won 10 of his 12 previous matches against Kohlschreiber, a 35-year-old German. But Kohlschreiber beat Djokovic at the Indian Wells tournament this year. If Kohlschreiber can use his varied shot selection to find Djokovic’s weaknesses early in the match, he may have a chance before Djokovic’s physical stamina can overwhelm him in the best-of-five-set format.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/01/sports/01tennis-watch/merlin_157194696_51114d9b-5db7-4c5f-b837-408657a7de93-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 405, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/07/01/sports/01tennis-watch/merlin_157194696_51114d9b-5db7-4c5f-b837-408657a7de93-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 405}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/01/sports/01tennis-watch/merlin_157194696_51114d9b-5db7-4c5f-b837-408657a7de93-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 691, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/01/sports/01tennis-watch/merlin_157194696_51114d9b-5db7-4c5f-b837-408657a7de93-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1382, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/01/sports/01tennis-watch/01tennis-watch-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/07/01/sports/01tennis-watch/01tennis-watch-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/01/sports/01tennis-watch/01tennis-watch-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'What to Watch Monday at Wimbledon', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tennis', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wimbledon Tennis Tournament', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Auger-Aliassime, Felix (2000- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Anderson, Kevin (1986- )', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gauff, Cori (2004- )', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Herbert, Pierre-Hugues (1991- )', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kohlschreiber, Philipp', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Osaka, Naomi (1997- )', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pospisil, Vasek', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Putintseva, Yulia (1995- )', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Williams, Venus', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-07-01T04:08:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Max Gendler', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Max', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gendler', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1bc195eb-5175-530b-a78b-49ebc5911b99', 'word_count': 545, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1bc195eb-5175-530b-a78b-49ebc5911b99'}, {'abstract': 'Is it still pretending if everyone can see through it?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/07/01/arts/television/big-little-lies-episode-4-recap.html', 'snippet': 'Is it still pretending if everyone can see through it?', 'lead_paragraph': 'Good therapists (does Dr. Reisman still count?) will sometimes tell you that the reason we all fall into patterns, making the same mistakes over and over, is because the pain we’ve experienced in the past drives us to recreate the situation that caused it — so we can fix it. The subconscious wants a do over. It’s why we “marry” our fathers and mothers. It’s why we become them, and then realize we’re becoming them, and then fight so hard against becoming them.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/01/arts/01lies-recap/fb4c9aff74014188b651c1d25c352638-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 426, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/07/01/arts/01lies-recap/fb4c9aff74014188b651c1d25c352638-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 426}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/01/arts/01lies-recap/fb4c9aff74014188b651c1d25c352638-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 727, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/01/arts/01lies-recap/fb4c9aff74014188b651c1d25c352638-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1455, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/01/arts/01lies-recap/