. Yet Democrats are still being asked if a woman can be elected president.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/07/03/us/politics/women-presidential-candidates-2020.html', 'snippet': 'Female candidates are climbing in the polls and dominating debates. Yet Democrats are still being asked if a woman can be elected president.', 'lead_paragraph': 'GREENVILLE, S.C. — Some people whisper it, some apologize for it, and some are very careful to mention their neighbors — their neighbors would be the ones to ask.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/06/30/us/politics/30women1/merlin_156865164_afe3f507-3c2c-42f9-8914-6bd58ecbf0d8-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/06/30/us/politics/30women1/merlin_156865164_afe3f507-3c2c-42f9-8914-6bd58ecbf0d8-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/06/30/us/politics/30women1/merlin_156865164_afe3f507-3c2c-42f9-8914-6bd58ecbf0d8-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/06/30/us/politics/30women1/merlin_156865164_afe3f507-3c2c-42f9-8914-6bd58ecbf0d8-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/06/30/us/politics/30women1/30women1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/06/30/us/politics/30women1/30women1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth