orical Society showcases photojournalism by six women on the magazine’s front lines', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/07/03/arts/design/-life-magazine-women-photographers-new-york-historical-society-.html', 'snippet': 'An exhibition at the New-York Historical Society showcases photojournalism by six women on the magazine’s front lines', 'lead_paragraph': 'From the depths of the Depression to the height of the Vietnam War, the photo essays in Life magazine told Americans how to see themselves. But in the 36 years that the magazine was published as a weekly, only six of its full-time photographers were women. A mix of published and unpublished shots and the contact sheets from exactly one photo essay by each of these six make up “Life: Six Women Photographers” at the New-York Historical Society’s Center for Women’s History.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/05/arts/05nyhs-review1/merlin_157013826_328e3300-c11e-4bbd-ab96-96029298e35e-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 630, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/07/05/arts/05nyhs-review1/merlin_157013826_328e3300-c11e-4bbd-ab96-96029298e35e-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 630}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/05/arts/05nyhs-review1/merlin_157013826_328e3300-c11e-4bbd-ab96-96029298e35e-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 975, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/05/arts/05nyhs-review1/merlin_157013826_328e3300-c11e-4bbd-ab96-96029298e35e-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1350, 'width': 1285, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/05/arts/05nyhs-review1/03nyhs-review1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/07/05/arts/05nyhs-review1/03nyhs-review1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/05/arts/05nyhs-review1/03nyhs-review1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Female Gaze Behind Life Magazine', 'kicker': 'Art Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Female Gaze at Life Magazine', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Museums', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New-York Historical Society', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Life (Magazine)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-07-03T17:51:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Art & Design', 'byline': {'original': 'By Will Heinrich', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Will', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Heinrich', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/ce26ee69-6c01-5158-bcd9-56a4141e2c7a', 'word_count': 667, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ce26ee69-6c01-5158-bcd9-56a4141e2c7a'}, {'abstract': 'Genetic analysis of remains from ruins in Israel hints at the origins of the Levantine people described in the Hebrew Bible.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/07/03/science/philistines-dna-origins.html', 'snippet': 'Genetic analysis of remains from ruins in Israel hints at the origins of the Levantine people described in the Hebrew Bible.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For thousands of years, the story of the Philistines has been told through the lens of their enemies, such as the ancient Egyptians, Babylonians, Assyrians and the writers of the Hebrew Bible — who described David’s defeat of Goliath, the mighty Philistine warrior.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/09/science/03TB-PHILLISTINES4/merlin_157411599_f2dd10b8-9fb9-4a4a-87c7-c4630d1579ab-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/07/09/science/03TB-PHILLISTINES4/merlin_157411599_f2dd10b8-9fb9-4a4a-87c7-c4630d1579ab-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/09/science/03TB-PHILLISTINES4/merlin_157411599_f2dd10b8-9fb9-4a4a-87c7-c4630d1579ab-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/09/science/03TB-PHILLISTINES4/merlin_157411599_f2dd10b8-9fb9-4a4a-87c7-c4630d1579ab-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1364, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/09/science/03TB-PHILLISTINES4/03TB-PHILLISTINES4-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/07/09/science/03TB-PHILLISTINES4/03TB-PHILLISTINES4-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit'