t the pain and hardships of racial minorities.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There are tanks in the nation’s capital and concentration camps on its border. The slide of this nation into a nearly unrecognizable state continues unabated. Donald Trump is recreating America in his own image: an abominable one.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/03/opinion/03blowWeb/merlin_157015023_b4c17ce7-6067-4f3c-af7e-7c4114d2be90-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/07/03/opinion/03blowWeb/merlin_157015023_b4c17ce7-6067-4f3c-af7e-7c4114d2be90-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/03/opinion/03blowWeb/merlin_157015023_b4c17ce7-6067-4f3c-af7e-7c4114d2be90-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/03/opinion/03blowWeb/merlin_157015023_b4c17ce7-6067-4f3c-af7e-7c4114d2be90-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/03/opinion/03blowWeb/03blowWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/07/03/opinion/03blowWeb/03blowWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/03/opinion/03blowWeb/03blowWeb-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'It’s the Cruelty, Stupid', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United States International Trade Commission', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Human Rights and Human Rights Violations', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Immigration and Emigration', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Immigration Detention', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Family Separation Policy (US Immigration)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-07-03T23:11:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Charles M. Blow', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Charles', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/7b5b00ca-42b3-5758-828e-946025247bb5', 'word_count': 968, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7b5b00ca-42b3-5758-828e-946025247bb5'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Malas’s resonant voice and sly comic timing served him well in numerous secondary roles. A starring role, and acclaim, came late in his career on Broadway.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/07/03/arts/music/spiro-malas-dead.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Malas’s resonant voice and sly comic timing served him well in numerous secondary roles. A starring role, and acclaim, came late in his career on Broadway.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Spiro Malas, a charming bass whose career in supporting roles at New York City Opera and the Metropolitan Opera blossomed, after decades,