es at 86', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Spiro Malas, 86, Trusty Bass In Operas and Surprise Star Of ‘Most Happy Fella,’ Dies', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'MALAS, SPIRO', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Opera', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Metropolitan Opera', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'The Most Happy Fella (Play)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-07-03T23:18:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Obits', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Zachary Woolfe', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Zachary', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Woolfe', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/d1b11cd5-9b29-5cb5-a851-e91e0be647d3', 'word_count': 908, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d1b11cd5-9b29-5cb5-a851-e91e0be647d3'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Trump’s statements come after weeks of public backlash and allegations over how the Border Patrol cares for detained migrants.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/07/03/us/politics/trump-border-patrol.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Trump’s statements come after weeks of public backlash and allegations over how the Border Patrol cares for detained migrants.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — President Trump said on Wednesday that migrants were “living far better” in Border Patrol detention centers than in their home countries, one day after his own administration reported that children in some facilities were denied hot meals or showers, and that cells were so crowded that migrants begged to be freed.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source'