nds of autoworkers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'With its focus on a future of self-driving cars and renewable fuels, General Motors is leaving some manufacturing plants like the one in Lordstown, Ohio, in its rearview. Workers who spent a lifetime at the plant — and constructed their lives around G.M. as they built the company’s cars — are losing their jobs. But this round of layoffs is different from the decades-old shifts in the auto industry. Competition from Silicon Valley, pressure from Wall Street and fundamental changes in how we get around are forcing the company to transform itself. It may be easy to say it’s not fair, but the American economy may not have room for fairness anymore.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'G.M. Leaves Lordstown Behind in Hard Bet on Future', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'General Motors', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Layoffs and Job Reductions', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'LORDSTOWN (OHIO)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Barra, Mary T', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'FX (TV Network)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Hulu.com', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tavernise, Sabrina', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'The Weekly (TV Program)', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-07-05T04:00:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Universal', 'section_name': 'The Weekly', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/eb456335-b0b8-5295-b93a-0ed798c135e8', 'word_count': 790, 'uri': 'nyt://article/eb456335-b0b8-5295-b93a-0ed798c135e8'}, {'abstract': 'Finally, I could be openly gay anywhere — except while visiting a certain relative.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/07/05/style/modern-love-gay-conversion-husband-doesnt-exist.html', 'snippet': 'Finally, I could be openly gay anywhere — except while visiting a certain relative.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I rang the doorbell of my grandmother’s house before remembering to pull off my wedding ring. I slipped it into my pocket and, just like that, I was someone else — an actor playing a fictional version of me.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/07/fashion/07MODERNLOVE/merlin_157426683_c8e3d4f2-3260-414a-8ef2-324a56c4d09a-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 752, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/07/07/fashion/07MODERNLOVE/merlin_157426683_c8e3d4f2-3260-414a-8ef2-324a56c4d09a-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 752}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/07/fashion/07MODERNLOVE/merlin_157426683_c8e3d4f2-3260-414a-8ef2-324a56c4d09a-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 818, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/07/fashion/07MODERNLOVE/merlin_157426683_c8e3d4f2-3260-414a-8ef2-324a56c4d09a-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1635, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/07/fashion/07MODERNLOVE/07MODERNLOVE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {