Day', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2019-07-05T04:18:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Summary', 'section_name': 'Today’s Paper', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f20b52e2-c2e3-5eda-a6c6-4cea45efbef3', 'word_count': 48, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f20b52e2-c2e3-5eda-a6c6-4cea45efbef3'}, {'abstract': 'No corrections appeared in print on Friday, July 5, 2019.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/07/05/pageoneplus/corrections-july-5-2019.html', 'snippet': 'No corrections appeared in print on Friday, July 5, 2019.', 'lead_paragraph': 'No corrections appeared in print on Friday, July 5, 2019.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Corrections: July 5, 2019', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Corrections', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2019-07-05T04:19:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Corrections', 'section_name': 'Corrections', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Correction', '_id': 'nyt://article/ea99cfde-06ff-5169-a302-19ac952b3553', 'word_count': 74, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ea99cfde-06ff-5169-a302-19ac952b3553'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Cline was a well-known philanthropist and Republican donor who began working in the coal industry in West Virginia.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/07/05/us/chris-cline-dead.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Cline was a well-known philanthropist and Republican donor who began working in the coal industry in West Virginia.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Chris Cline, a billionaire entrepreneur, philanthropist and political donor once called the “King of Coal,” died Thursday in a helicopter crash in the Bahamas that officials said killed seven people.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/05/multimedia/05xp-cline-update/05xp-cline-update-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/07/05/multimedia/05xp-cline-update/05xp-cline-update-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/05/multimedia/05xp-cline-update/05xp-cline-update-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/05/multimedia/05xp-cline-update/05xp-cline-update-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/05/multimedia/05xp-cline-update/05xp-cline-update-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/07/05/multimedia/05xp-cline-update/05xp-cline-update-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/05/multimedia/05xp-cline-update/05xp-cline-update-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Chris Cline, Coal Mining Entrepreneur, Is Killed in Helicopter Crash', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Coal Billionaire, a Major G.O.P. Donor, Dies in a Helicopter Crash', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cline, Christopher (1958-2019)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Aviation Accidents, Safety and Disasters', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Fatalities)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coal', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mines and Mining', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Bahama Islands', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-07-05T04:43:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Express', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Liam Stack and Mariel Padilla', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Liam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Stack', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Mariel', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Padilla', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/02a1fc21-89f5-5649-bcb6-c8808f34b1dd', 'word_count': 769, 'uri': 'nyt://article/02a1fc21-89f5-5649-bcb6-c8808f34b1dd'}, {'abstract': 'Olivia Cooke and Anya Taylor-Joy play teens with dark sides in “Thoroughbreds.” And Benedikt Erlingsson’s “Woman at War” hits Hulu.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/07/05/arts/television/whats-on-tv-friday.html', 'snippet': 'Olivia Cooke and Anya Taylor-Joy play teens with dark sides in “Thoroughbreds.” And Benedikt Erlingsson’s “Woman at War” hits Hulu.', 'lead_paragraph': 'THOROUGHBREDS (2018) 8:25 p.m. on HBO. “You ever think about just killing him?” That question is tossed out by Amanda (Olivia Cooke), an emotionally stunted high school student, in reference to her friend Lily’s stepfather in this debut from the writer-director Cory Finley. “How … would you?” Lily (Anya Taylor-Joy) replies, in a muted manner. Amanda and Lily are a pair of erstwhile friends brought back together by circumstance: The studious Lily is enlisted to tutor Amanda, whose troubled nature is bared at the beginning of the movie, when she kills her injured horse with a knife. This film is about their friendship, and their increasingly inability to reign in their darker sides. Though direct summation is difficult: “For all the chatter and intrigue,” Manohla Dargis wrote in her review for The New York Times, Finley “never settles on a point or theme.” But, she wrote, the director “gives the movie a professional sheen and gets fine performances from his actors.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/05/arts/05tvcol-thoroughbreds/merlin_134678870_a5dd398c-0a96-477b-8d47-5b626d7c7805-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/07/05/arts/05tvcol-thoroughbreds/merlin_134678870_a5dd398c-0a96-477b-8d47-5b626d7c7805-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/05/arts/05tvcol-thoroughbreds/merlin_134678870_a5dd398c-0a96-477b-8d47-5b626d7c7805-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/05/arts/05tvcol-thoroughbreds/merlin_134678870_a5dd398c-0a96-477b-8d47-5b626d7c7805-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/05/arts/05tvcol-thoroughbreds/merlin_134678870_a5dd398c-0a96-477b-8d47-5b626d7c7805-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/07/05/arts/05tvcol-thoroughbreds/merlin_134678870_a5dd398c-0a96-477b-8d47-5b626d7c7805-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/05/arts/05tvcol-thoroughbreds/merlin_134678870_a5dd398c-0a96-477b-8d47-5b626d7c7805-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'What’s on TV Friday: ‘Thoroughbreds’ and ‘Woman at War’', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'What’s On Friday', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-07-05T05:00:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Television', 'byline': {'original': 'By Gabe Cohn', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Gabe', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cohn', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/390b77a9-1bab-50bf-8528-61c8cb058c93', 'word_count': 491, 'uri': 'nyt://article/390b77a9-1bab-50bf-8528-61c8cb058c93'}, {'abstract': 'Cori Gauff looks to continue her run, and Andy Murray and Serena Williams team up in mixed doubles.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/07/05/sports/tennis/what-to-watch-wimbledon-cori-gauff.html', 'snippet': 'Cori Gauff looks to continue her run, and Andy Murray and Serena Williams team up in mixed doubles.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Halep, the winner of the 2018 French Open and a former world No. 1, hasn’t had the best year. For her, that means reaching only the round of 16 at the Australian Open and the quarterfinals at the French Open. On Centre Court for the third round of Wimbledon, she will face Azarenka, another former No. 1 and the winner of two Australian Open titles. Their last meeting was at Wimble