designer gave the house, and a step into an unknown future.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/07/05/fashion/fendi-lagerfeld-couture-rome.html', 'snippet': 'The couture show at the Temple of Venus and Rome was a fitting homage to just how much the designer gave the house, and a step into an unknown future.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ROME — There has been some debate over how Karl Lagerfeld, former creative director of Chanel and Fendi, the man who essentially defined the role of the modern creative director until his death in February at age — well, no one is entirely sure; general guess is 85 — would have felt about the extravagant memorial held two weeks ago in Paris. He famously, after all, never wanted a grand public funeral. He hated looking back.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/05/fashion/05FENDi-2/merlin_157485906_b7e4f540-1b3b-422c-8149-b418b86dfbc2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/07/05/fashion/05FENDi-2/merlin_157485906_b7e4f540-1b3b-422c-8149-b418b86dfbc2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/05/fashion/05FENDi-2/merlin_157485906_b7e4f540-1b3b-422c-8149-b418b86dfbc2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/05/fashion/05FENDi-2/merlin_157485906_b7e4f540-1b3b-422c-8149-b418b86dfbc2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/05/fashion/05FENDi-2/05FENDi-2-thumbStandard.