in, he won an Oscar and a Grammy for his work on the film “West Side Story” and 12 Clio Awards for his work in TV advertising.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/07/05/arts/music/sid-ramin-dead.html', 'snippet': 'A childhood friend of Leonard Bernstein, he won an Oscar and a Grammy for his work on the film “West Side Story” and 12 Clio Awards for his work in TV advertising.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Sid Ramin, an orchestrator, arranger and composer who won both an Oscar and a Grammy for his work on the film “West Side Story” and whose career outlets ranged from revered Broadway musicals to perfume commercials, died on Monday at his home in Manhattan. He was 100.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/06/obituaries/06Ramin-obit1/merlin_10720421_f0cbf208-e976-4b3d-b22f-e4b9a883671b-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/07/06/obituaries/06Ramin-obit1/merlin_10720421_f0cbf208-e976-4b3d-b22f-e4b9a883671b-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/06/obituaries/06Ramin-obit1/merlin_10720421_f0cbf208-e976-4b3d-b22f-e4b9a883671b-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/06/obituaries/06Ramin-obit1/merlin_10720421_f0cbf208-e976-4b3d-b22f-e4b9a883671b-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1362, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/06/obituaries/06Ramin-obit1/merlin_10720421_f0cbf208-e976-4b3d-b22f-e4