d of dancing with his friends at an event called Yes and Yes Yes (described as an “unconference” which allowed for three days of unconventional, informal and unscheduled discussions). He spotted Ms. Davis sitting at a table by herself, with a lightning bolt painted across her face like David Bowie.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/07/fashion/weddings/07DAVIS-mini-sub/merlin_157364895_e61e6e29-32d7-424a-b6b7-67ca624de544-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/07/07/fashion/weddings/07DAVIS-mini-sub/merlin_157364895_e61e6e29-32d7-424a-b6b7-67ca624de544-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/07/fashion/weddings/07DAVIS-mini-sub/merlin_157364895_e61e6e29-32d7-424a-b6b7-67ca624de544-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/07/fashion/weddings/07DAVIS-mini-sub/merlin_157364895_e61e6e29-32d7-424a-b6b7-67ca624de544-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/07/fashion/weddings/07DAVIS-mini-sub/merlin_157364895_e61e6e29-32d7-424a-b6b7-67ca624de544-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/07/07/fashion/weddings/07DAVIS-mini-sub/merlin_157364895_e61e6e29-32d7-424a-b6b7-67ca624de544-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/07/fashion/weddings/07DAVIS-mini-sub/merlin_157364895_e61e6e29-32d7-424a-b6b7-67ca624de544-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'This Week’s Wedding Announcements', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Weddings and Engagements', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-07-07T04:30:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Obits', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'subsection_name': 'Weddings', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2975701d-df9d-5baa-9bdc-388e02c2c85a', 'word_count': 5142, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2975701d-df9d-5baa-9bdc-388e02c2c85a'}, {'abstract': 'Corrections appearing in print on Sunday, July 7, 2019.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/07/07/pageoneplus/corrections-july-7-2019.html', 'snippet': 'Corrections appearing in print on Sunday, July 7, 2019.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ARTS & LEISURE', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Corrections: July 7, 2019', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Corrections', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2019-07-07T04:42:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Corrections', 'section_name': 'Corrections', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Correction', '_id': 'nyt://article/6043561d-05af-5f7b-99ed-963829645668', 'word_count': 446, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6043561d-05af-5f7b-99ed-963829645668'}, {'abstract': 'Quotation of the Day for Sunday, July 7, 2019.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/07/07/todayspaper/quotation-of-the-day-when-debate-pits-abortions-vs-black-lives.html', 'snippet': 'Quotation of the Day for Sunday, July 7, 2019.', 'lead_paragraph': '“As much as I believe with all my heart about the killing, the taking of innocent lives, I also believe that I will never support giving white legislators who have no interest in our community the ability to tell our women what they can do with their bodies.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Quotation of the Day: When Debate Pits Abortions vs. Black Lives', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Quote of the Day', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2019-07-07T04:43:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Summary', 'section_name': 'Today’s Paper', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Quote', '_id': 'nyt://article/f4febe4e-4520-562e-aec8-55965e060ed5', 'word_count': 71, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f4febe4e-4520-562e-aec8-55965e060ed5'}, {'abstract': 'The executive producers of CNN’s Decades series tackle cinema, and Starz’s time-travel love story is available to stream on Netflix.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/07/07/arts/television/whats-on-tv-sunday-the-movies-and-outlander.html', 'snippet': 'The executive producers of CNN’s Decades series tackle cinema, and Starz’s time-travel love story is available to stream on Netflix.', 'lead_paragraph': 'THE MOVIES 9 p.m. on CNN. CNN’s decade-focused series “The Sixties,” “The Seventies,” “The Eighties,” “The Nineties” and “The 2000s” have covered a lot of ground, exploring the major political and pop cultural moments of the last 50-plus years. Now the series’s executive producers, Tom Hanks, Gary Goetzman and Mark Herzog, are shifting their focus to American cinema with their new mini-series “The Movies.” The six-part program will cover major film moments from the 1930s to the present, and will feature interviews with Martin Scorsese, Steven Spielberg, Molly Ringwald, Anjelica Huston and Robert Redford, among others. The series kicks off with a two-hour premiere focusing on the films of the 1980s, from sci-fi hits like “E.T.” “The Empire Strikes Back” and “Back to the Future” to comedies like “The Breakfast Club” and “Coming to America.” The episode pairs perfectly with the new season of “Stranger Things” on Netflix, and will likely be a great primer for that show’s many ’80s references.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/07/arts/07tvcol-movies/07tvcol-movies-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 449, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/07/07/arts/07tvcol-movies/07tvcol-movies-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 449}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/07/arts/07tvcol-movies/07tvcol-movies-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 767, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/07/arts/07tvcol-movies/07tvcol-movies-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1533, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/07/arts/07tvcol-movies/07tvcol-movies-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/07/07/arts/07tvcol-movies/07tvcol-movies-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/07/arts/07tvcol-movies/07tvcol-movies-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 1