 leave his post in January, and Matthew Rushing will take over. Also, Ronni Favors, an ex-Ailey member, will become rehearsal director.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/07/08/arts/dance/alvin-ailey-masazumi-chaya-steps-down.html', 'snippet': 'Masazumi Chaya will leave his post in January, and Matthew Rushing will take over. Also, Ronni Favors, an ex-Ailey member, will become rehearsal director.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Masazumi Chaya, the associate artistic director of Alvin Ailey American Dance Theater since 1991, will retire on Jan. 5, 2020, after the company’s annual City Center season. But he’ll still be involved with the organization: After he steps down, Mr. Chaya, 72, will be in charge of a licensing project that will assist in the restaging of Ailey’s works.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/09/arts/08ailey-2-chaya/merlin_157436730_d25190fa-232c-40b3-8eb2-e519c562c551-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 764, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/07/09/arts/08ailey-2-chaya/merlin_157436730_d25190fa-232c-40b3-8eb2-e519c562c551-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 764}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/09/arts/08ailey-2-chaya/merlin_157436730_d25190fa-232c-40b3-8eb2-e519c562c551-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 805, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/09/arts/08ailey-2-chaya/merlin_157436730_d25190fa-232c-40b3-8eb2-e519c562c551-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1610, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image