mp’s re-election efforts. But experts said many of the president’s claims weren’t based in fact.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/07/08/us/politics/trump-environment-climate-change.html', 'snippet': 'Consultants thought the speech would help President Trump’s re-election efforts. But experts said many of the president’s claims weren’t based in fact.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Reviewing new polling data, consultants working for President Trump’s 2020 campaign discovered an unsurprising obstacle to winning support from two key demographic groups, millennials and suburban women. And that was his record on the environment.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/08/us/politics/08dc-trump-sub/merlin_157678065_82fdd242-5df9-403f-9f43-3b03e9d6132e-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/07/08/us/politics/08dc-trump-sub/merlin_157678065_82fdd242-5df9-403f-9f43-3b03e9d6132e-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/08/us/politics/08dc-trump-sub/merlin_157678065_82fdd242-5df9-403f-9f43-3b03e9d6132e-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/08/us/politics/08dc-trump-sub/merlin_157678065_82fdd242-5df9-403f-9f43-3b03e9d6132e-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/08/us/politics/08dc-trump-sub/08dc-trump-sub-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 