jor': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Voice of America', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bennett, Amanda', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lansing, John F', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Regalado, Tomas P', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Regalado, Tomas N', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Radio y Television Marti', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ethics and Official Misconduct', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-07-08T20:38:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Washington', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Elizabeth Williamson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Elizabeth', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Williamson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/74c53569-2040-519c-a0f6-b38e5b7b23cf', 'word_count': 1164, 'uri': 'nyt://article/74c53569-2040-519c-a0f6-b38e5b7b23cf'}, {'abstract': 'Will Horowitz of Harry & Ida’s coaxes ballpark flavors from carrots for his By Chloe vegan dog.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/07/08/dining/by-chloe-carrot-hot-dog.html', 'snippet': 'Will Horowitz of Harry & Ida’s coaxes ballpark flavors from carrots for his By Chloe vegan dog.', 'lead_paragraph': 'To make the new carrot dog for By Chloe, the chef Will Horowitz and his sister, Julie Horowitz, who own Harry & Ida’s in the East Village, cure large carrots for several days. Then they slow-smoke them. The process takes about a week. The result is a properly smoky-tasting hot-dog look-alike, grilled and nestled in a bun with mustard and sauerkraut. The texture is crunchy, not succulent and still carrot. It’s a tasty novelty and one that Samantha Wasser, a founder of By Chloe, a fast-casual chain that uses only plant-based ingredients, considered to be perfect for her restaurants. She said she loved that it wasn’t highly processed, “unlike most plant-based meat substitutes like burgers and sausages.” Mr. Horowitz, who is known for his real pastrami, is increasingly experimenting with vegetables like radishes that look like cured meat and smoked celery root to mimic turkey. “I’m starting to pivot our entire smokehouse business in this direction,” he said.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/10/dining/08burner1/merlin_157409439_5369f07d-a04c-4f64-90ff-fc64413a2e53-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/07/10/dining/08burner1/merlin_157409439_5369f07d-a04c-4f64-90ff-fc64413a2e53-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/10/dining/08burner1/merlin_157409439_5369f07d-a04c-4f64-90ff-fc64413a2e53-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/10/dining/08burner1/merlin_157409439_5369f07d-a04c-4f64-90ff-fc64413a2e53-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/10/dining/08burner1/merlin_157409439_5369f07d-a04c-4f64-90ff-fc64413a2e53-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/07/10/dining/08burner1/merlin_157409439_5369f07d-a04c-4f64-90ff-fc64413a2e53-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/10/dining/08burner1/merlin_157409439_5369f07d-a04c-4f64-90ff-fc64413a2e53-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Leap in Hot Dog Technology', 'kicker': 'Front Burner', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'To Surprise: Vegan Hot Dogs Make a Scrumptious Leap', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Vegetables', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hot Dogs and Frankfurters', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Carrots', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Horowitz, William H (1982- )', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'By Chloe (Manhattan, NY, Restaurant)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-07-08T20:38:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Florence Fabricant', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Florence', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fabricant', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7a6d3f62-8c9a-5899-a922-5f82c1c37ce9', 'word_count': 190, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7a6d3f62-8c9a-5899-a922-5f82c1c37ce9'}, {'abstract': 'Dine on sushi from the chef Masaharu Morimoto on a Monday night cruise in New York Harbor.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/07/08/dining/morimoto-sushi-cruise.html', 'snippet': 'Dine on sushi from the chef Masaharu Morimoto on a Monday night cruise in New York Harbor.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Sunset on the Hudson is just one attraction for a series of cruises from Classic Harbor Line. In addition to the views, America 2.0 — a polished wood-trimmed yacht designed with a nod to the original America’s Cup winner from 1851 and led by a crew mostly of women — provides a selection of sakes to accompany sushi plates created by the chef Masaharu Morimoto. He will be on board for the cruise on July 29.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/08/dining/08burnerboat1/merlin_157509936_da245d68-1a96-405c-9bfe-9be7551c94d2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/07/08/dining/08burnerboat1/merlin_157509936_da245d68-1a96-405c-9bfe-9be7551c94d2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/08/dining/08burnerboat1/merlin_157509936_da245d68-1a96-405c-9bfe-9be7551c94d2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/08/dining/08burnerboat1/merlin_157509936_da245d68-1a96-405c-9bfe-9be7551c94d2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/08/dining/08burnerboat1/08burnerboat1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/07/08/dining/08burnerboat1/08burnerboat1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/08/dini