 half focuses on the defense and presents Carter as a troubled young woman who truly believed she could help Roy.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/08/arts/09tvcol-iloveyou/c23991f150f149f7b8e4c22466a2a9dc-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/07/08/arts/09tvcol-iloveyou/c23991f150f149f7b8e4c22466a2a9dc-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/08/arts/09tvcol-iloveyou/c23991f150f149f7b8e4c22466a2a9dc-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/08/arts/09tvcol-iloveyou/c23991f150f149f7b8e4c22466a2a9dc-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1080, 'width': 1920, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/08/arts/09tvcol-iloveyou/08tvcol-iloveyou-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/07/08/arts/09tvcol-iloveyou/08tvcol-iloveyou-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/08/arts/09tvcol-iloveyou/08tvcol-iloveyou-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'What’s on TV Tuesday: ‘I Love You, Now Die’ and ‘Love Island’', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'What’s On Tuesday', 