iendship and petty theft in alligator country.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Has a television channel ever gotten more traction from fewer shows than Pop? Beginning life as Prevue, the rolling grid of localized TV listings, and eventually becoming Pop in 2015, the cable channel has been banking good will in the younger demographics with its one significant scripted original series, the cult Canadian comedy “Schitt’s Creek.” Recently it boosted that credibility with a show it hasn’t even carried yet, earning praise for picking up the canceled Netflix sitcom “One Day at a Time.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/10/arts/09floridagirls-review/merlin_157658004_7f24e69c-4c11-4efc-bd05-066f4c478d5b-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/07/10/arts/09floridagirls-review/merlin_157658004_7f24e69c-4c11-4efc-bd05-066f4c478d5b-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/10/arts/09floridagirls-review/merlin_157658004_7f24e69c-4c11-4efc-bd05-066f4c478d5b-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/10/arts/09floridagirls-review/merlin_157658004_7f24e69c-4c11-4efc-bd05-066f4c478d5b-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/10/arts/09floridagirls-review/09floridagirls-review-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'l