news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael M. Grynbaum', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b1284a9f-805f-50cb-b3c3-d23d2cbeb986', 'word_count': 524, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b1284a9f-805f-50cb-b3c3-d23d2cbeb986'}, {'abstract': 'Recipe planners such as eMeals and PlateJoy can wean you off prepared foods and teach you to love cooking.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/07/09/smarter-living/wirecutter/-how-a-meal-planning-service-made-me-a-better-cook.html', 'snippet': 'Recipe planners such as eMeals and PlateJoy can wean you off prepared foods and teach you to love cooking.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I used to hate cooking. I’d avoid it at all costs, sustaining myself on frozen pizzas, simple burritos, and, when I wanted to get fancy, a Caesar salad. Fed up with myself, I finally tried a subscription meal planning service — where I pay an app to send me handpicked recipes every week — and over the past five years, I’ve learned to cook hundreds of meals, using countless novel ingredients. The experience has cultivated my appreciation and enjoyment of cooking in a way nothing else has.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/13/smarter-living/13help-meal/00wc-mealplanning-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/07/13/smarter-living/13help-meal/00wc-mealplanning-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/13/smarter-living/13help-meal/00wc-mealplanning-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/13/smarter-living/13help-meal/00wc-mealplanning-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/13/smarter-living/13help-meal/00wc-mealplanning-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/07/13/smarter-living/13help-meal/00wc-mealplanning-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/13/smarter-living/13help-meal/00wc-mealplanning-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'How a Meal Planning Service Made Me a Better Cook', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Here to Help; How to Know If a Meal Planner Is Right for You', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Food', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Recipes', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mobile Applications', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'your-feed-wirecutter', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-07-09T21:30:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Smarter Living', 'section_name': 'Smarter Living', 'subsection_name': 'Wirecutter', 'byline': {'original': 'By Thorin Klosowski', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Thorin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Klosowski', 'qualifier': None, '