ve the things that inspire you.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The need to take notes goes back through centuries of human history. It’s no wonder, then, that even the earliest desktop systems in the 1980s included a basic “notepad” program. But digital note-taking tools have been improving rapidly. Far beyond simple typed text, you can now save photos, audio and video clips, web links, sketches and more — all on your smartphone. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/10/technology/personaltech/10TECHTIP_TOPART/330dfc0a26e947af8f874a2a0102ba50-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 482, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/07/10/technology/personaltech/10TECHTIP_TOPART/330dfc0a26e947af8f874a2a0102ba50-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 482}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/10/technology/personaltech/10TECHTIP_TOPART/330dfc0a26e947af8f874a2a0102ba50-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 823, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/10/technology/personaltech/10TECHTIP_TOPART/330dfc0a26e947af8f874a2a0102ba50-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1646, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/10/technology/personaltech/10TECHTIP_TOPART/10TECHTIP_TOPART-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/07/10/technology/personaltech/10TECHTIP_TOPART/10TECHTIP_TOPART-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank