o think that politicians care about what their constituents want. If voters in a legislative district have certain views about, say, the legality of abortion, we assume that their representative’s decisions will be shaped, or at least influenced, by those views. To a large extent, democracy depends on this assumption: The beliefs of voters should be reflected, however imperfectly, in the leaders they elect.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/11/opinion/sunday/11PorterKallasub/11PorterKallasub-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 500, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/07/11/opinion/sunday/11PorterKallasub/11PorterKallasub-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 500}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/11/opinion/sunday/11PorterKallasub/11PorterKallasub-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 853, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/11/opinion/sunday/11PorterKallasub/11PorterKallasub-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1500, 'width': 1800, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/11/opinion/sunday/11PorterKallasub/11PorterKallasub-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/07/11/opinion/sunday/11PorterKallasub/11PorterKallasub-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/11/opinion/sunday/11PorterKallasub/11PorterKallasub-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Politicians Don’t Actually Care What Voters Want', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Politicians Don’t Care What You Think', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Polls and Public Opinion', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-07-11T15:00:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Joshua Kalla and Ethan Porter', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Joshua', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kalla', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Ethan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Porter', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/574e2356-3868-5b92-92b7-529b86804b59', 'word_count': 869, 'uri': 'nyt://article/574e2356-3868-5b92-92b7-529b86804b59'}, {'abstract': 'President Trump’s suggestion conveys a grave misunderstanding of what migrants are facing. Democrats need to show that they have a better plan.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/07/11/opinion/immigration-trump-border.html', 'snippet': 'President Trump’s suggestion conveys a grave misunderstanding of what migrants are facing. Democrats need to show that they have a better plan.', 'lead_paragraph': 'President Trump seems to think that holding children and families in federal government custody without beds, soap, toothbrushes or even adequate food might stem migration from Central America.  Recent reporting on these conditions in migrant detention facilities has intensified critiques of this administration’s brutal approach to the families who are coming in record numbers to our southern border. In an apparent response to that scrutiny, Mr. Trump said in a tweet, “If Illegal Immigrants are unhappy with the conditions in the quickly built or refitted detentions centers, just tell them not to come. All problems solved!"', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/11/opinion/11McDonoughMunoz2/merlin_157375254_be2fe401-618f-49ac-bca5-cc8220e74ee8-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 451, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/07/11/opinion/11McDonoughMunoz2/merlin_157375254_be2fe401-618f-49ac-bca5-cc8220e74ee8-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 451}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/11/opinion/11McDonoughMunoz2/merlin_157375254_be2fe401-618f-49ac-bca5-cc8220e74ee8-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 769, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/11/opinion/11McDonoughMunoz2/merlin_157375254_be2fe401-618f-49ac-bca5-cc8220e74ee8-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1538, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/11/opinion/11McDonoughMunoz2/11McDonoughMunoz2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/07/11/opinion/11McDonoughMunoz2/11McDonoughMunoz2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/11/opinion/11McDonoughMunoz2/11McDonoughM