oncertmaster, Jakob Lehmann.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/07/11/arts/music/teatro-nuovo-jakob-lehmann.html', 'snippet': 'Teatro Nuovo’s performances are a rare case: They’ll be led not by a maestro, but by the concertmaster, Jakob Lehmann.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It isn’t unusual to see a violinist — rather than a maestro — leading a small orchestra in early music, or in works from the Baroque or Classical eras. It is extremely rare, however, to see one conducting bel canto operas, with their larger ensembles and layered rhythms, often delivered at a sprint.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/11/arts/11nuovo-1/merlin_157635786_1af6444b-f199-4949-87f8-61a73f1799a1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/07/11/arts/11nuovo-1/merlin_157635786_1af6444b-f199-4949-87f8-61a73f1799a1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/11/arts/11nuovo-1/merlin_157635786_1af6444b-f199-4949-87f8-61a73f1799a1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/11/arts/11nuovo-1/merlin_157635786_1af6444b-f199-4949-87f8-61a73f1799a1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/11/arts/11nuovo-1/merlin_157635786_1af6444b-f199-4949-87f8-61a73f1799a1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/