', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/07/12/nyregion/hector-figueroa-union-leader-with-impact-dies-at-57.html', 'snippet': 'As head of New York’s Service Employees union, he successfully campaigned for better pay and working conditions for more than 170,000 people.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Hector Figueroa, who as president of one of the country’s most influential labor unions led successful campaigns for better pay and working conditions for thousands of low-wage workers, died on Thursday at his home in Jackson Heights, Queens. He was 57.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/14/obituaries/14Figueroa-obit/merlin_157850379_dd85992e-ad11-4f42-a80a-b29d713649d8-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/07/14/obituaries/14Figueroa-obit/merlin_157850379_dd85992e-ad11-4f42-a80a-b29d713649d8-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/14/obituaries/14Figueroa-obit/merlin_157850379_dd85992e-ad11-4f42-a80a-b29d713649d8-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/14/obituaries/14Figueroa-obit/merlin_157850379_dd85992e-ad11-4f42-a80a-b29d713649d8-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/14/obituaries/14Figueroa-obit/12Figueroa-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/07/14/