9, 'uri': 'nyt://article/06c1da0f-523f-5c0f-a770-b53b886ad4e5'}, {'abstract': 'This play, a response to the rise in the deaths of journalists, is a reminder that imprisonment can happen to anyone.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/07/12/theater/no-one-is-forgotten-review.html', 'snippet': 'This play, a response to the rise in the deaths of journalists, is a reminder that imprisonment can happen to anyone.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The women in the cell could be journalists, they could be activists, they could be aid workers. They don’t seem to know where they are or how long their captivity has lasted. They have little hope of release, unless if by release you mean death. Death they look forward to.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/12/arts/12noone-sub/merlin_157754187_0f07efee-2096-49ca-9883-d3fad0f66998-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/07/12/arts/12noone-sub/merlin_157754187_0f07efee-2096-49ca-9883-d3fad0f66998-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/12/arts/12noone-sub/merlin_157754187_0f07efee-2096-49ca-9883-d3fad0f66998-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/12/arts/12noone-sub/merlin_157754187_0f07efee-2096-49ca-9883-d3fad0f66998-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/12/arts/12noone-sub/12noone-sub-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height'