d open champagne from a warming fridge. “I loved the darkness,” one said.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/07/14/nyregion/nyc-blackout-scenes.html', 'snippet': 'They roasted hot dogs on the pavement and cracked open champagne from a warming fridge. “I loved the darkness,” one said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A major blackout had knocked out power to much of the West Side of Manhattan on Saturday night, but Danielle Allen sat in the crook of a doorway with the blissed-out look of a sunbather. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/20/nyregion/14BLACKOUT-SCENE-1/14BLACKOUT-SCENE-1-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/07/20/nyregion/14BLACKOUT-SCENE-1/14BLACKOUT-SCENE-1-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/20/nyregion/14BLACKOUT-SCENE-1/14BLACKOUT-SCENE-1-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/20/nyregion/14BLACKOUT-SCENE-1/14BLACKOUT-SCENE-1-superJumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/20/nyregion/14BLACKOUT-SCENE-1/14BLACKOUT-SCENE-1-thumbStandard-v4.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/07/20/nyregion/14BLACKOUT-SCENE-1/14BLACKOUT-SCENE-1-thumbStandard-v4.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'ca