-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/16/nyregion/16nychousing/16nychousing-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'What the City Didn’t Want the Public to Know: Its Policy Deepens Segregation', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'More Affordable Housing, but Report Finds More Racial Segregation', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Segregation and Desegregation', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Suits and Litigation (Civil)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hispanic-Americans', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Blacks', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Black People', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Affordable Housing', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Race and Ethnicity', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Real Estate and Housing (Residential)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Beveridge, Andrew A', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Been, Vicki L', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'de Blasio, Bill', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-07-16T09:00:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By J. David Goodman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'J.', 'middlename': 'David', 'lastname': 'Goodman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/be58c073-53ff-58c6-9b5f-58c2a8620a74', 'word_count': 1015, 'uri': 'nyt://article/be58c073-53ff-58c6-9b5f-58c2a8620a74'}, {'abstract': 'Mistoa is a new cheese, made with sheep and goat milks, inspired by a Basque favorite and aged in Queens.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/07/16/dining/mistoa-cheese.html', 'snippet': 'Mistoa is a new cheese, made with sheep and goat milks, inspired by a Basque favorite and aged in Queens.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Taking the jewel of Basque sheep milk cheeses, Ossau-Iraty, as its template, Murray’s Cheese has arranged to create their own with a cheesemaker in the valleys of the Pyrénées. The superb result, named Mistoa (meaning “mixed” in Basque), is made with some goat milk added to sheep milk, an unusual formula for the region. Hefty unaged wheels of it are sent to Murray’s cheese caves in Queens where they mature for three to four months; they are flipped all the while. The exterior is a sturdy gray rind, and the interior ivory, smooth and supple, with grassy, nutty aromas and a creamy, herbal flavor. The aftertaste tilts sharp.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/17/dining/15burnercheese02/15burnercheese02-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/07/17/dining/15burnercheese02/15burnercheese02-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/17/dining/15burnercheese02/15burnercheese02-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/17/dining/15burnercheese02/15burnercheese02-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/17/dining/15burnercheese02/15burnercheese02-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/07/17/dining/15burnercheese02/15burnercheese02-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/17/dining/15burnercheese02/15burnercheese02-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Born in the Pyrenees, Bred in New York', 'kicker': 'Front Burner', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'To Slice: Born in the Pyrenees,  Bred in New York', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cheese', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "Murray's Cheese Shop", 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-07-16T09:00:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Florence Fabricant', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Florence', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fabricant', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9550115e-53c9-51aa-9fe9-af29e694d1c5', 'word_count': 141, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9550115e-53c9-51aa-9fe9-af29e694d1c5'}, {'abstract': 'As social media expands its cultural dominance, the people who can steer the online conversation will have an upper hand.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/07/16/technology/vidcon-social-media-influencers.html', 'snippet': 'As social media expands its cultural dominance, the people who can steer the online conversation will have an upper hand.', 'le