://article/b2b67c97-17a8-577e-bb81-a2ef9b587ea0'}, {'abstract': 'She and her family, whom she later wrote about, were among the last Jews to flee what she called a “cultural holocaust” and ended up in Brooklyn in the early 1960s.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/07/17/books/lucette-lagnado-dead.html', 'snippet': 'She and her family, whom she later wrote about, were among the last Jews to flee what she called a “cultural holocaust” and ended up in Brooklyn in the early 1960s.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Lucette Lagnado, a journalist and author whose memoirs chronicled her Jewish family’s longing for an exodus-in-reverse after an agonizing departure from Egypt to America in the early 1960s, died on July 10 in Manhattan. She was 62.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/19/obituaries/15Lagnado3/merlin_48578435_2269178f-d15d-4de4-ab8d-1bd2cd2fd6e6-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 906, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/07/19/obituaries/15Lagnado3/merlin_48578435_2269178f-d15d-4de4-ab8d-1bd2cd2fd6e6-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 906}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/19/obituaries/15Lagnado3/merlin_48578435_2269178f-d15d-4de4-ab8d-1bd2cd2fd6e6-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 678, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/19/obituaries/15Lagnado3/merlin_48578435_2269178f-d15d-4de4-ab8d-1bd2cd2fd6e6-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1356, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/19/obituaries