 'nyt://article/41d8ffaa-8524-5bbd-b9e9-7ba6590b1824'}, {'abstract': 'She was already an accomplished jazz bandleader when she began releasing pop albums for Elektra in 1978. A new best-of compilation looks back at her major-label career.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/07/17/arts/music/patrice-rushen-jazz.html', 'snippet': 'She was already an accomplished jazz bandleader when she began releasing pop albums for Elektra in 1978. A new best-of compilation looks back at her major-label career.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The sounds of the 1970s and ’80s feel newly alive in pop today. Listen to Beyoncé cover Frankie Beverly, or Kendrick Lamar sample the Isley Brothers, or any Teyana Taylor track, and you’re also hearing the music of 30 to 40 years ago.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/17/arts/17rushen2/merlin_157850472_0626d186-3b15-40b2-94ed-c78519315c16-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/07/17/arts/17rushen2/merlin_157850472_0626d186-3b15-40b2-94ed-c78519315c16-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/17/arts/17rushen2/merlin_157850472_0626d186-3b15-40b2-94ed-c78519315c16-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/17/arts/17rushen2/merlin_157850472_0626d186-3b15-40b2-94ed-c78519315c16-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/17/arts/17rushen2/