 of your cybersecurity is a parody.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/07/17/world/europe/bulgaria-hack-cyberattack.html', 'snippet': 'The data of more than five million people was stolen from Bulgaria’s tax agency. Someone emailed a claim of responsibility to news outlets, writing, “The state of your cybersecurity is a parody.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'An investigation into the theft of the personal information of nearly every adult in Bulgaria led to the arrest of a 20-year-old computer programmer, the police announced Wednesday, in connection with a breach that underscores the vulnerability of vast troves of digitized information.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/17/world/17BULGARIA-01/merlin_158021994_ee68b2a5-885c-4ea7-8871-59ff2d525c23-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/07/17/world/17BULGARIA-01/merlin_158021994_ee68b2a5-885c-4ea7-8871-59ff2d525c23-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/17/world/17BULGARIA-01/merlin_158021994_ee68b2a5-885c-4ea7-8871-59ff2d525c23-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/17/world/17BULGARIA-01/merlin_158021994_ee68b2a5-885c-4ea7-8871-59ff2d525c23-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/17/world/17BULGARIA-01/17BULGARIA-01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop