sthand how he embodied judicial, moral and personal independence.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/07/17/opinion/john-paul-stevens.html', 'snippet': 'I was lucky enough to see firsthand how he embodied judicial, moral and personal independence.', 'lead_paragraph': 'My solace on hearing the news of John Paul Stevens’s death is that he went quickly. I saw him for the last time two months ago, at a reunion he held for his law clerks near his home in Fort Lauderdale, Fla. Physically, he appeared as well as anyone could expect of someone who had just turned 99. His mind was as sharp as it was when I finished my clerkship with him 12 years ago. He suffered a stroke on Monday and on Tuesday he was gone.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '27', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/17/opinion/17greene1/17greene1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 398, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/07/17/opinion/17greene1/17greene1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 398}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/17/opinion/17greene1/17greene1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 680, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/17/opinion/17greene1/17greene1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1359, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/17/opinion/17greene1/17greene1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/07/17/opinion/17greene1/17greene1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thum