 Kevin K. McAleenan, the acting secretary of homeland security, of leading an agency with an “empathy deficit” during a hearing on Thursday that focused on the separation of migrant children from their parents and reports of poor conditions at holding facilities near the border.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/18/us/politics/18dc-dhs1/18dc-dhs1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/07/18/us/politics/18dc-dhs1/18dc-dhs1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/18/us/politics/18dc-dhs1/18dc-dhs1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/18/us/politics/18dc-dhs1/18dc-dhs1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/18/us/politics/18dc-dhs1/18dc-dhs1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/07/18/us/politics/18dc-dhs1/18dc-dhs1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/18/us/politics/18dc-dhs1/18dc-dhs1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '‘They Are Human Beings’: Homeland Security Faulted for Treatment of Migrant Children', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Homeland Security Chief Faces Stern Questioning', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Family Separation Policy (US Immigration)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Immigration Detention', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Border Patrol (US)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Customs and Border Protection (US)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Homeland Security Department', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House Committee on Oversight and Government Reform', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McAleenan, Kevin K', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cummings, Elijah E', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ocasio-Cortez, Alexandria', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-07-18T22:35:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Washington', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Zolan Kanno-Youngs', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Zolan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kanno-Youngs', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/faf076a1-4f55-571b-b5ce-695207e47297', 'word_count': 944, 'uri': 'nyt://article/faf076a1-4f55-571b-b5ce-695207e47297'}, {'abstract': 'As I.R.S. commissioner in the Kennedy administration, Mr. Caplin promised to be “both reasonable and vigorous” and largely succeeded.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/07/18/us/politics/mortimer-caplin-dead.html', 'snippet': 'As I.R.S. commissioner in the Kennedy administration, Mr. Caplin promised to be “both reasonable and vigorous” and largely succeeded.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Mortimer Caplin, who as Internal Revenue commissioner in the early 1960s was credited with making taxpaying more tolerable for the majority of Americans who do so voluntarily and tougher for the rest to avoid or evade, died on Monday at his home in Chevy Chase, Md. He was 103.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/19/obituaries/18Caplin1/merlin_158078310_d5ee008a-20eb-47cf-86ff-abda1c92773a-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 543, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/07/19/obituaries/18Caplin1/merlin_158078310_d5ee008a-20eb-47cf-86ff-abda1c92773a-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 543}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/19/obituaries/18Caplin1/merlin_158078310_d5ee008a-20eb-47cf-86ff-abda1c92773a-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 926, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/19/obituaries/18Caplin1/merlin_158078310_d5ee008a-20eb-47cf-86ff-abda1c92773a-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1853, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/19/obituaries/18Caplin1/18Caplin1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/07/19/obituaries/18Caplin1/18Caplin1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'i