uri': 'nyt://article/83dafee6-e970-5641-8b2a-1e8738c877d1'}, {'abstract': 'The party no longer stands for much of anything.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/07/20/opinion/sunday/republicans-united-states.html', 'snippet': 'The party no longer stands for much of anything.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The tragedy of today’s Republican Party lies partly in how far it has tumbled from its heights.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/21/opinion/21kristofSub/merlin_156655737_93b38599-5781-4ccd-92b4-4ebaf18cba58-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/07/21/opinion/21kristofSub/merlin_156655737_93b38599-5781-4ccd-92b4-4ebaf18cba58-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/21/opinion/21kristofSub/merlin_156655737_93b38599-5781-4ccd-92b4-4ebaf18cba58-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/21/opinion/21kristofSub/merlin_156655737_93b38599-5781-4ccd-92b4-4ebaf18cba58-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/21/opinion/21kristofSub/21kristofSub-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/07/21/opinion/21kristofSub/21kristofSub-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/21/opinion/21kristofSub/21kristofSub-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The G.O.P. Is Now a Personality Cult', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The G.O.P. Is Now a Personality Cult', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Conservatism (US Politics)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2020', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-07-20T18:30:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'subsection_name': 'Sunday Review', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nicholas Kristof', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nicholas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kristof', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/713c319e-6381-59a0-9c2f-24e39e2cbd44', 'word_count': 845, 'uri': 'nyt://article/713c319e-6381-59a0-9c2f-24e39e2cbd44'}, {'abstract': 'Stop talking so much about the America that he’s destroying. Save your breath for the America you want to create.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/07/20/opinion/sunday/trump-squad-democrats-2020.html', 'snippet': 'Stop talking so much about the America that he’s destroying. Save your breath for the America you want to create.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Surprise, surprise: Donald Trump has no bottom. Just when you think he has sunk as low as he can, he stages a rally like that atrocity in North Carolina on Wednesday night and sinks lower. But the key takeaway isn’t that he’s a demagogue or a racist: These were facts put into evidence long ago. It’s that Democrats can’t afford to take unnecessary risks, dream deferrable dreams and engage in avoidable distractions as they set about the urgent work of defeating him. The 2020 election isn’t about getting everything that Democrats want and that Americans deserve. It’s about getting rid of Trump, because the price of not doing so could be this nation’s very soul.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/21/opinion/sunday/21bruni/21bruni-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 670, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/07/21/opinion/sunday/21bruni/21bruni-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 670}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/21/opinion/sunday/21bruni/21bruni-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 918, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/21/opinion/sunday/21bruni/21bruni-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1836, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/21/opinion/sunday/21bruni/21bruni-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/07/21/opinion/sunday/21bruni/21bruni-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/21/opinion/sunday/21bruni/21bruni-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_na