anslate into judicial virtues.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/07/20/opinion/sunday/justice-stevens.html', 'snippet': 'Fine personal qualities do not always translate into judicial virtues.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Like so many others, I was saddened to learn of the passing of Justice John Paul Stevens. He was a fellow Midwesterner, honest, self-effacing and kind, but with a strong independent streak and a passion for justice. I had the privilege of interviewing with him for a clerkship once, and then observing him up close for a year as I clerked for Chief Justice William Rehnquist. He was the quintessential gentleman and scholar.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/21/opinion/sunday/21mcdonald/21mcdonald-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 546, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/07/21/opinion/sunday/21mcdonald/21mcdonald-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 546}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/21/opinion/sunday/21mcdonald/21mcdonald-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 932, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/21/opinion/sunday/21mcdonald/21mcdonald-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1620, 'width': 1780, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/21/opinion/sunday/21mcdonald/21mcdonald-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/07/21/opinion/sunday/21mcdonald/21mcdonald-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75