nic cleansing.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/07/22/world/middleeast/israel-demolition-palestinian-housing.html', 'snippet': 'The first of 10 mostly unfinished apartment buildings in a Palestinian area was razed, an act that Palestinian officials condemned as “ethnic cleansing.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'JERUSALEM — Israeli equipment arrived before dawn on Monday and began clawing at the first of 10 Palestinian apartment blocks that were scheduled for demolition because the government said they were built too close to its security barrier in a Palestinian area of the West Bank abutting Israeli-annexed East Jerusalem.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/22/world/22Jerusalem1/merlin_158289801_ac589fc2-3f7b-4e4d-b25e-a61a83eb9130-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/07/22/world/22Jerusalem1/merlin_158289801_ac589fc2-3f7b-4e4d-b25e-a61a83eb9130-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/22/world/22Jerusalem1/merlin_158289801_ac589fc2-3f7b-4e4d-b25e-a61a83eb9130-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/22/world/22Jerusalem1/merlin_158289801_ac589fc2-3f7b-4e4d-b25e-a61a83eb9130-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/22/world/22Jerusalem1/22Jerusalem1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandar