s.com/2019/07/22/dining/tomato-salad-ottolenghi.html', 'snippet': 'Not every vegetable needs to be raw. Yotam Ottolenghi chars his vegetables for salads that can be served over pasta, tucked into sandwiches or used as a dip.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON —\xa0When you hear “summer salad,” I bet the first thing that comes to mind isn’t a bunch of vegetables cooked within an inch of their lives and left to hang out so their juices meld and their flavors turn hearty and complex. These kinds of techniques are usually left to robust meaty stews or wintry soups, and not applied to the cream of the summer’s freshest and juiciest crop.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/24/dining/22ottolenghi1/merlin_158045637_975d824f-2589-4d32-a6d2-7c1ca1f8224c-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/07/24/dining/22ottolenghi1/merlin_158045637_975d824f-2589-4d32-a6d2-7c1ca1f8224c-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/24/dining/22ottolenghi1/merlin_158045637_975d824f-2589-4d32-a6d2-7c1ca1f8224c-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/24/dining/22ottolenghi1/merlin_158045637_975d824f-2589-4d32-a6d2-7c1ca1f8224c-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/24/dining/22ottolenghi1/merlin_158045637_975d824f-2589-4d32-a6d2-7c1ca1f8224c-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75