orld. But where it persists, rabies takes a particular toll on the rural poor.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/07/22/science/rabies-dogs-global.html', 'snippet': 'The virus has been defeated in many parts of the world. But where it persists, rabies takes a particular toll on the rural poor.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Rabies has been known since antiquity, and has been completely preventable since Pasteur developed a vaccine more than a century ago. But the World Health Organization still considers it “a neglected disease of poor and vulnerable populations.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/15/science/00rabies-15/merlin_154097928_4451c0d1-15fd-4dcb-8acb-f41f1e56e866-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/07/15/science/00rabies-15/merlin_154097928_4451c0d1-15fd-4dcb-8acb-f41f1e56e866-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/15/science/00rabies-15/merlin_154097928_4451c0d1-15fd-4dcb-8acb-f41f1e56e866-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/15/science/00rabies-15/merlin_154097928_4451c0d1-15fd-4dcb-8acb-f41f1e56e866-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/15/science/00rabies-15/00rabies-15-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/07/15/science/00rabies-15/00rabies-15-thumbStandard.jpg', 't