g a double murder in India and a notorious vigilante killing in the American Midwest.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/07/22/arts/television/review-i-love-you-now-die-who-killed-garrett-phillips-hbo.html', 'snippet': 'HBO and Sundance TV are offering a high-end selection of documentaries about crimes including a double murder in India and a notorious vigilante killing in the American Midwest.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There’s a contradiction built into the phrase “true crime”: Most of that booming genre’s most popular works depend, for their effect, on the unknowability of the truth. It may be strongly suspected or widely assumed, but its elusiveness makes possible the combination of investigation and outrage that draws us in. If you want a satisfying resolution, you’re better off watching crime fiction.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/23/arts/22truecrime/22truecrime-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 364, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/07/23/arts/22truecrime/22truecrime-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 364}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/23/arts/22truecrime/22truecrime-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 622, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/23/arts/22truecrime/22truecrime-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1200, 'width': 1976, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/23/arts/22truecrime/22truecrime-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thu