d_count': 216, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3d8a621f-a805-50bb-a44c-72bcfb6a994d'}, {'abstract': 'McQueen and the Violet Fog is made in Brazil, and has the right notes for a martini with a twist.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/07/22/dining/mcqueen-and-the-violet-fog-gin.html', 'snippet': 'McQueen and the Violet Fog is made in Brazil, and has the right notes for a martini with a twist.', 'lead_paragraph': 'McQueen and the Violet Fog may not have been developed for the Aviation, a gin cocktail that is made with violet liqueur, but its name, and the whisper of lavender, in this new gin from Brazil makes it a fine choice. The small batch spirit is made in copper pot stills with a raft of botanicals. It is gentle, with some spicy notes, and pairs nicely with tonic. It delivers citrus, too, so you might consider it in a martini with a twist. The makers say it’s bottled by hand. As for the name, it comes from a poem about a mysterious rock band.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/24/dining/22burner3/22burner3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 822, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/07/24/dining/22burner3/22burner3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 822}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/24/dining/22burner3/22burner3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 748, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/24/dining/22burner3/22burner3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1496, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images