 1047, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6a39b155-c872-5da5-9093-a8a8e3fba6e9'}, {'abstract': 'The president gushed about the prospect of improved relations and trade with Pakistan if it helps negotiate a cease-fire to bring home American troops from Afghanistan.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/07/22/world/asia/trump-pakistan-afghanistan.html', 'snippet': 'The president gushed about the prospect of improved relations and trade with Pakistan if it helps negotiate a cease-fire to bring home American troops from Afghanistan.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — President Trump, who on Twitter last year accused Pakistan’s leaders of “nothing but lies & deceit,” welcomed the country’s prime minister to the White House on Monday in an effort to mend relations and seek help in ending the war in neighboring Afghanistan.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/22/us/politics/22dc-prexy-sub/22dc-prexy-sub-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/07/22/us/politics/22dc-prexy-sub/22dc-prexy-sub-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/22/us/politics/22dc-prexy-sub/22dc-prexy-sub-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/22/us/politics/22dc-prexy-sub/22dc-prexy-sub-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/22/us/politics/22dc-prexy-sub/22dc-prexy-sub-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/07/22/us/politics/22dc-prexy-sub/22dc-prexy-sub-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/22/us/politics/22dc-prexy-sub/22dc-prexy-sub-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Trump Tries Cooling Tensions With Pakistan to Speed Afghan Peace Talks', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Trump, Seeking to Mend Relations, Welcomes Pakistan’s Leader', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Pakistan', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Afghanistan War (2001- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Khan, Imran', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Foreign Aid', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Taliban', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'AFGHANISTAN', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-07-22T20:07:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Washington', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael D. Shear and Salman Masood', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1ef76f55-01f1-5bc0-83d5-76564944747c', 'word_count': 1325, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1ef76f55-01f1-5bc0-83d5-76564944747c'}, {'abstract': 'In this handsome book, Anna Francese Gass tells the stories of dozens of immigrants through their recipes.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/07/22/dining/heirloom-kitchen-cookbook.html', 'snippet': 'In this handsome book, Anna Francese Gass tells the stories of dozens of immigrants through their recipes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The author of “Heirloom Kitchen” is an Italian-American who attended culinary school and wanted to record her immigrant mother’s recipes. The project led her to explore the cooking of other immigrant women. In this attractive volume, she has recorded the cooking and the experiences, both daunting and gratifying, of 37 of them from 30 different countries. Recipes include Ukranian apple pancake, made with grated apple; Peruvian ceviche, studded with sweet potato; and an intricately braided Serbian “Danish” strip that’s much easier than it looks.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/24/dining/22burner2/22burner2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 830, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/07/24/dining/22burner2/22burner2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 830}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/24/dining/22burner2/22burner2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 740, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/24/dining/22burner2/22burner2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1480, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/24/dining/22burner2/22burner2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/07/24/dining/22burner2/22burner2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/24/dining/22burner2/22burner2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'An American Tale', 'kicker': 'Front Burner', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'To Understand: Immigrants’ Stories Told Through Recipes', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gass, Anna Francese', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Heirloom Kitchen: Heritage Recipes and Family Stories From the Tables of Immigrant Women (Book)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-07-22T20:18:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Florence Fabricant', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Florence', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fabricant', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7796939a-0382-54ae-a6c8-4818be26b33d', 'word_count': 129, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7796939a-0382-54ae-a6c8-4818be26b33d'}, {'abstract': 'We want to hear from those living in Puerto Rico on how corruption and cutbacks in public services have affected you or your family.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/07/22/reader-center/puerto-rico-protests-economy.html', 'snippet': 'We want to hear from those living in Puerto Rico on how corruption and cutbacks in public services have affected you or your family.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Puerto Rico is facing a major political crisis as tens of thousands demand the resignation of its governor, Ricardo A. Rosselló. Protesters filled miles of a major highway on Monday in San Juan, joining a massive demonstration against Mr. Rosselló, who is resisting calls to resign. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/23/insider/23-rc-puertorico/23-rc-puertorico-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 362, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/07/23/insider/23-rc-puertorico/23-rc-puertorico-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 362}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/23/insider/23-rc-puertorico/23-rc-puertorico-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 617, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/23/insider/23-rc-puertorico/23-rc-puertorico-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1234, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/23/insider/23-rc-puertorico/23-rc-puertorico-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/07/23/insider/23-rc-puertorico/23-rc-puertorico-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/23/insider/23-rc-puertorico/23-rc-puertorico-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Puerto Rico Has Faced Decades of Economic Problems. How Has It Affected You?', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Politics and Government', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rossello, Ricardo A (1979- )', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Puerto Rico', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Demonstrations, Protests and Riots', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-07-22T20:30:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'NewsDesk', 'section_name': 'Reader Center', 'byline': {'original': 'By Lela Moore', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Lela', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Moore', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1a8ed12b-9c6c-5a0d-898d-8fbcb5874ed9', 'word_count': 164, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1a8ed12b-9c6c-5a0d-898d-8fbcb5874ed9'}, {'abstract': 'These handmade redwood bowls are modeled on a ceramic one that the chef Alice Waters uses at home.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/07/22/dining/alice-waters-salad-bowl.html', 'snippet': 'These handmade redwood bowls are modeled on a ceramic one that the chef Alice Waters uses at home.', 'lead_paragraph': 'At nearly $500 for the salad bowl, you’d think Alice Waters would handpick and rinse the lettuces for you herself. But no, she only inspired the new bowl for the Permanent Collection online shop. It’s a beautiful piece, fairly shallow and 13 1/4 inches across, with an alluring natural pattern. Ms. Waters selected redwood for the material because it’s light in weight and also because she has an affinity for the trees, one of which is in her backyard. The shape of the bowl is based on a ceramic one that she uses at home and is lathe-turned by Bruce Mitchell, an artisan California woodworker. Five percent of the price is donated to Ms. Waters’s Edible Schoolyard Project.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/24/dining/22burner1/22burner1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 465, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/07/24/dining/22burner1/22burner1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 465}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/24/dining/22burner1/22burner1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 794, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/24/dining/22burner1/22burner1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1588, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/24/dining/22burner1/22burner1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/07/24/dining/22burner1/22burner1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/24/dining/22burner1/22burner1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Salad Bowl With an Heirloom Price', 'kicker': 'Front Burner', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'To Treasure: A Salad Bowl  With an Heirloom Price', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', '