 puzzle requires a one-on-one session.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TUESDAY PUZZLE — This Kyle Dolan puzzle is a fun snack. There are no debuts except for in the theme entries, no head-scratcher names, no start-ups that might go public next year.   There’s plenty of wit, though, and a few lively little tropes throughout the grid, along with a theme that misdirected me a couple of times as I solved from top to bottom. All in all, it’s a perfect mental break for a solver on a Tuesday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/23/crosswords/23wordplay-sedum/23wordplay-sedum-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/07/23/crosswords/23wordplay-sedum/23wordplay-sedum-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/23/crosswords/23wordplay-sedum/23wordplay-sedum-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/23/crosswords/23wordplay-sedum/23wordplay-sedum-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/23/crosswords/23wordplay-sedum/23wordplay-sedum-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/07/23/crosswords/23wordplay-sedum/23wordplay-sedum-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/23/crosswords/23wordplay