t at a table very close to the band. A young woman, probably 21 years old, noticed an empty seat at our table and asked if she could join us. I’ll call her Kim.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/10/07/magazine/28mag-ethicist-image1/28mag-ethicist-image1-articleLarge-v33.jpg', 'height': 336, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/10/07/magazine/28mag-ethicist-image1/28mag-ethicist-image1-articleLarge-v33.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 336}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/10/07/magazine/28mag-ethicist-image1/28mag-ethicist-image1-jumbo-v33.jpg', 'height': 574, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/10/07/magazine/28mag-ethicist-image1/28mag-ethicist-image1-superJumbo-v33.jpg', 'height': 1148, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/10/07/magazine/28mag-ethicist-image1/28mag-ethicist-image1-thumbStandard-v34.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/10/07/magazine/28mag-ethicist-image1/28mag-ethicist-image1-thumbStandard-v34.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/10/07/magazine/28mag-ethicist-image1/28mag-ethicist-image1-thumbLarge-v34.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Was It O.K. to Leave a Drunken W