: 932, 'uri': 'nyt://article/95169631-0129-5683-973a-f0fb1649bee9'}, {'abstract': 'President Trump’s inflammatory appeals to white working-class voters have not been matched by legislative accomplishments aimed at their financial well-being.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/07/23/us/politics/trump-working-class.html', 'snippet': 'President Trump’s inflammatory appeals to white working-class voters have not been matched by legislative accomplishments aimed at their financial well-being.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — History will record last week as a moment when President Trump turned to raw racial appeals to attack a group of nonwhite lawmakers, but his attacks also underscored a remarkable fact of his first term: His rhetorical appeals to white working-class voters have not been matched by legislative accomplishments aimed at their economic interests.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/23/us/politics/23dc-trumppopulism/merlin_158088600_8365a8bf-6a9a-44bc-9448-b7295c0cf891-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/07/23/us/politics/23dc-trumppopulism/merlin_158088600_8365a8bf-6a9a-44bc-9448-b7295c0cf891-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/23/us/politics/23dc-trumppopulism/merlin_158088600_8365a8bf-6a9a-44bc-9448-b7295c0cf891-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/23/us/politics/23dc-trumppopulism/merlin_158088600_8365a8bf-6a9a-44bc-9448-b7295c0cf891-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 's