8ef87d2-ea55-55f2-b42b-7c7afe928b14'}, {'abstract': 'A top aide to Robert S. Mueller III, Aaron Zebley, will sit next to Mr. Mueller during back-to-back hearings on Wednesday, and will be sworn in as a witness before the House Intelligence Committee.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/07/23/us/politics/mueller-zebley-witness-testimony.html', 'snippet': 'A top aide to Robert S. Mueller III, Aaron Zebley, will sit next to Mr. Mueller during back-to-back hearings on Wednesday, and will be sworn in as a witness before the House Intelligence Committee.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Robert S. Mueller III’s longtime right-hand aide will appear beside him to assist as he testifies before two House committees on Wednesday, and will be sworn in as a witness for one of the sessions, according to congressional officials familiar with the arrangement.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/23/us/politics/23dc-cong/merlin_154850640_48c29a06-c9e9-486a-be44-fdb6d864f771-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/07/23/us/politics/23dc-cong/merlin_154850640_48c29a06-c9e9-486a-be44-fdb6d864f771-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/23/us/politics/23dc-cong/merlin_154850640_48c29a06-c9e9-486a-be44-fdb6d864f771-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/23/us/politics/23dc-cong/merlin_154850640_48c29a06-c9e9-486a-be44-fdb6d864f771-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}