e some semblance of a normal life.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/07/23/movies/angels-are-made-of-light-review.html', 'snippet': 'A documentary about a relatively peaceful moment in Afghanistan captures ordinary people trying to live some semblance of a normal life.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Movies about war are a dime a dozen, but how do you film peace? In “Angels Are Made of Light,” the director James Longley trains his camera on a school in Kabul, Afghanistan, where young children and weary adults attempt to imagine something resembling a hopeful future. Though much of the country is still troubled by conflict, the capital appears to be slowly working toward a  sense of stability. And while the specter of war looms over Longley’s documentary, its shadow is subtle. The director is more interested in showing ordinary people trying to live some semblance of a normal life.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/24/arts/23angelsaremade/merlin_158307738_cfec2765-19de-47be-8925-8585d2a71f67-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 251, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/07/24/arts/23angelsaremade/merlin_158307738_cfec2765-19de-47be-8925-8585d2a71f67-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 251}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/24/arts/23angelsaremade/merlin_158307738_cfec2765-19de-47be-8925-8585d2a71f67-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 429, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/24/arts/23angelsaremade/merlin_158307738_cfec2765-19de-47be-8925-8585d2a71f67-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 858, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'sup