 visual effects supervisor, Adam Valdez, shares some of the secrets to making a digitally animated cub seem real.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/07/23/movies/simba-lion-king-technology.html', 'snippet': 'The visual effects supervisor, Adam Valdez, shares some of the secrets to making a digitally animated cub seem real.', 'lead_paragraph': 'While young Simba was working on his roar in the new “Lion King,” his designers and animators were laboring over a good deal more. All the hairs on the cub’s body, the detailed color patterns of his fur and the movement of his little legs through the savanna were the efforts of a Pride Rock-size army of visual effects artists. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/21/arts/23lionking1/merlin_154880472_6647f53b-1be2-43cd-87e0-ce26ebf1d4ed-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 316, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/07/21/arts/23lionking1/merlin_154880472_6647f53b-1be2-43cd-87e0-ce26ebf1d4ed-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 316}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/21/arts/23lionking1/merlin_154880472_6647f53b-1be2-43cd-87e0-ce26ebf1d4ed-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 540, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/21/arts/23lionking1/merlin_154880472_6647f53b-1be2-43cd-87e0-ce26ebf1d4ed-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1080, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/21/arts/23lionking1/23lionking1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subTyp