ds/making-order-out-of-chaos.html', 'snippet': 'After a woman and her family were forced to flee the breakaway republic of Somaliland in 2003, jigsaw puzzles gave her a way to cope and figure out what would come next.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There is an order to putting a jigsaw puzzle together, a routine. Concrete answers can be found inside a box of jigsaw puzzle pieces, and in that, there is comfort. Until the box tips over. Or a toddler spills juice on it. Or a piece slips between the couch cushions. Barring one of these puzzle-size catastrophes, the puzzle will be finished, smooth and connected.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/24/crosswords/24wordplay-solver-story-art-jones/24wordplay-solver-story-art-jones-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/07/24/crosswords/24wordplay-solver-story-art-jones/24wordplay-solver-story-art-jones-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/24/crosswords/24wordplay-solver-story-art-jones/24wordplay-solver-story-art-jones-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/24/crosswords/24wordplay-solver-story-art-jones/24wordplay-solver-story-art-jones-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1354, 'width': 2030, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/24/crosswords/24wordplay-solver-story-art-jones/24wordplay-solver-story-art-jones-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStand