IVAL", 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Priests', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Discrimination', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Race and Ethnicity', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Immigration and Emigration', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-07-24T22:28:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Carol Giacomo', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Carol', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Giacomo', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/616716ff-5443-57cb-a0d1-4e69e9a5ce17', 'word_count': 863, 'uri': 'nyt://article/616716ff-5443-57cb-a0d1-4e69e9a5ce17'}, {'abstract': 'You don’t have to be thrilling if you’re willing.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/07/24/opinion/mueller-testimony-reactions.html', 'snippet': 'You don’t have to be thrilling if you’re willing.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When it comes to tamping down excitement, Robert Mueller is a genius. He soldiered on through two much-anticipated House committee hearings, full of politicians eager to make a splash. The result was … muted.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '25', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/24/opinion/24collinsWeb/24collinsWeb-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 394, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/07/24/opinion/24collinsWeb/24collinsWeb-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 394}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/24/opinion/24collinsWeb/24collinsWeb-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 673, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/24/opinion/24collinsWeb/24collinsWeb-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1346, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/24/opinion/24collinsWeb/24collinsWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/07/24/opinion/24collinsWeb/24collinsWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/24/opinion/24collinsWeb/24collinsWeb-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'How to Take Down Trump', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'How to Take Down Trump', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mueller, Robert S III', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Russian Interference in 2016 US Elections and Ties to Trump Associates', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Special Prosecutors (Independent Counsel)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-07-24T23:08:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Gail Collins', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Gail', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Collins', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/a77ec00b-0722-5267-bc0f-5a462ba54209', 'word_count': 882, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a77ec00b-0722-5267-bc0f-5a462ba54209'}, {'abstract': 'Robert S. Mueller III’s long-anticipated testimony before two House committees broke little new ground, but under questioning, the former special counsel had his moments.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/07/24/us/politics/mueller-testimony-takeaways.html', 'snippet': 'Robert S. Mueller III’s long-anticipated testimony before two House committees broke little new ground, but under questioning, the former special counsel had his moments.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — After months of anticipation, Robert S. Mueller III, the former special counsel, on Wednesday delivered nearly seven hours of dry, sometimes halting testimony before Congress. Republicans and Democrats sparred over his conclusions, but in back-to-back hearings, Mr. Mueller mostly reiterated the findings of his two-year investigation into Russian interference in the 2016 election without offering any significant new disclosures.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What We Learned From Mueller’s 7 Hours on Capitol Hill', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Many Dodges, and a Few Darts, From a Tight-Lipped Witness', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Russian Interference in 2016 US Elections and Ties to Trump Associates', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Special Prosecutors (Independent Counsel)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Impeachment', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ethics and Official Misconduct', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mueller, Robert S III', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-07-24T23:11:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Washington', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nicholas Fandos', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nicholas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fandos', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7530afb8-2fc9-5046-a16a-e12a7c8a2260', 'word_count': 1832, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7530afb8-2fc9-5046-a16a-e12a7c8a2260'}, {'abstract': 'Will the results of this congressional hearing be enough for the Democratic leaders to pursue impeachment?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/07/24/opinion/mueller-impeach.html', 'snippet': 'Will the results of this congressional hearing be enough for the Democratic leaders to pursue impeachment?', 'lead_paragraph': 'Well folks, there you have it. Special Counsel Robert Mueller has completed his testimony. There are no more shoes to drop.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/24/opinion/24blowWeb/24blowWeb-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 369, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/07/24/opinion/24blowWeb/24blowWeb-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 369}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/24/opinion/24blowWeb/24blowWeb-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 630, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/24/opinion/24blowWeb/24blowWeb-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1261, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/24/opinion/24blowWeb/24blowWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/07/24/opinion/24blowWeb/24blowWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/24/opinion/24blowWeb/24blowWeb-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Mueller Testified. Now What?', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Impeachment', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Russian Interference in 2016 US Elections and Ties to Trump Associates', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mueller, Robert S III', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Special Prosecutors (Independent Counsel)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-07-24T23:16:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Charles M. Blow', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Charles', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/716e06f8-abaf-59de-9190-2ffda1372ee4', 'word_count': 889, 'uri': 'nyt://article/716e06f8-abaf-59de-9190-2ffda1372ee4'}, {'abstract': 'Bob Mueller made clear the threat to American democracy is urgent. The politicians had other things on their minds.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/07/24/opinion/robert-mueller-report-testimony.html', 'snippet': 'Bob Mueller made clear the threat to American democracy is urgent. The politicians had other things on their minds.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If you were searching for a metaphor for the withering ideal of American public service — the one that puts country before party, truth before “narrative” or “brand” — it’d be hard to do better than the painful spectacle of Robert Mueller trying, in his halting voice, to sound the alarm on Wednesday about Russian subversion of American democracy.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/24/opinion/24testimony/24testimony-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/07/24/opinion/24testimony/24testimony-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/24/opinion/24testimony/24testimony-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 598, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/24/opinion/24testimony/24testimony-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1196, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/24/opinion/24testimony/24testimony-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/07/24/opinion/24testimony/24testimony-thum