the helpless sorrow of a grown daughter watching her mother die, the unfathomable anguish of parents who never expected to outlive their offspring. In the face of such suffering, how can anyone manage to overcome other than to — as Ovid wrote — “bear and endure”? I would say: through poems like this one. Selected by Rita Dove', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/28/magazine/28mag-poem-1/28mag-poem-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 332, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/07/28/magazine/28mag-poem-1/28mag-poem-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 332}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/28/magazine/28mag-poem-1/28mag-poem-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 345, 'width': 623, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/28/magazine/28mag-poem-1/28mag-poem-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 345, 'width': 623, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/28/magazine/28mag-poem-1/28mag-poem-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/07/28/magazine/28mag-poem-1/28mag-poem-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/28/magazine/28mag-poem-1/28mag-poem-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Poem: 636 Lyons Avenue, Apartment 1A', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Poetry and Poets', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-07-25T09:00:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Magazine', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrea Hollander and Rita Dove', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrea', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hollander', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Rita', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Dove', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a0005ed0-807d-58b4-b98d-4e1a1c4eaf25', 'word_count': 259, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a0005ed0-807d-58b4-b98d-4e1a1c4eaf25'}, {'abstract': 'In a survey, only about one in three American men who were at high risk for H.I.V. infection took Truvada to prevent transmission.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/07/25/well/live/most-high-risk-men-dont-take-prep-to-prevent-hiv.html', 'snippet': 'In a survey, only about one in three American men who were at high risk for H.I.V. infection took Truvada to prevent transmission.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Among men who are at high risk for H.I.V. infection, only about one in three is taking a drug to prevent transmission of the virus, according to a survey from the Centers for Disease Control and Prevention. The drug, Truvada, is taken daily as part of a preventive strategy called pre-exposure prophylaxis, or PrEP.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/06/18/well/18well_pog_drugs/well_pog_drugs-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/06/18/well/18well_pog_drugs/well_pog_