4, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c115297f-a9bf-5385-8af4-cb468ad5af2d'}, {'abstract': 'There’s a lot more to the case against Mr. Trump and his associates.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/07/25/opinion/robert-mueller-hearings.html', 'snippet': 'There’s a lot more to the case against Mr. Trump and his associates.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On Wednesday, in sworn congressional testimony, Special Counsel Robert Mueller publicly confirmed 100 percent of the devastating findings of his report, and made clear that his inquiry does not exonerate the president. Within 24 hours, though, the conversation has coalesced around a few superficial observations: Mr. Mueller underperformed and the Republicans overplayed their hand, but in the end, this is just about the end of the road for investigations around President Trump, let alone talk of impeachment.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/25/opinion/25Fredrickson1/25Fredrickson1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 415, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/07/25/opinion/25Fredrickson1/25Fredrickson1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 415}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/25/opinion/25Fredrickson1/25Fredrickson1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 708, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/25/opinion/25Fredrickson1/25Fredrickson1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1416, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/25/opinion/25Fredrickson1/25Fredrickson1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subTyp