riority before it is too late.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/07/28/opinion/jay-inslee-donald-trump-climate-democratic-primary.html', 'snippet': 'We need a president who will make it a priority before it is too late.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I’ve heard it my whole career, from pundits, special interests and even political consultants: Just shut up about climate change if you want to be elected. They set up a false dichotomy between the economy and the environment, saying you can’t fight for good jobs and for clean air.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/28/opinion/28inslee/merlin_146716773_dea48f98-785a-4055-90d2-2d121086eed7-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 389, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/07/28/opinion/28inslee/merlin_146716773_dea48f98-785a-4055-90d2-2d121086eed7-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 389}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/28/opinion/28inslee/merlin_146716773_dea48f98-785a-4055-90d2-2d121086eed7-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 664, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/28/opinion/28inslee/merlin_146716773_dea48f98-785a-4055-90d2-2d121086eed7-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1328, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/28/opinion/28inslee/28inslee-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/07/28/opinion/28inslee/28inslee-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/28/opinion/28inslee/28inslee-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Jay Inslee: Climate Change Is a Winning Campaign Issue — and President Trump Knows It', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Climate Is  A Winning Issue', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Global Warming', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2020', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Oil (Petroleum) and Gasoline', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Alternative and Renewable Energy', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Environmental Protection Agency', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Democratic Party', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-07-28T23:00:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jay Inslee', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jay', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Inslee', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/575a48ba-cff4-5c37-a9ca-b2842e165f35', 'word_count': 853, 'uri': 'nyt://article/575a48ba-cff4-5c37-a9ca-b2842e165f35'}, {'abstract': 'It’s absurd how restrictive they are, given growing inequality in housing.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/07/28/opinion/affordable-housing-zoning-golden-girls.html', 'snippet': 'It’s absurd how restrictive they are, given growing inequality in housing.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The housing plans released by the Democratic presidential candida