ht have been crippling for previous presidents, but many in the party are not convinced they will benefit in 2020.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/07/30/us/politics/donald-trump-racism.html', 'snippet': 'The president’s racially divisive attacks on Democrats of color might have been crippling for previous presidents, but many in the party are not convinced they will benefit in 2020.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — For three weeks President Trump has engaged in the sort of racial divisiveness unseen from a national political figure since the days of George Wallace, pushing forward with grievance-based attacks against Democrats of color that he is convinced will energize his base of rural white voters.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/30/us/politics/30trump-gop1/merlin_158088105_7010c627-6efb-4c2a-a0b5-ce97a2f140c1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/07/30/us/politics/30trump-gop1/merlin_158088105_7010c627-6efb-4c2a-a0b5-ce97a2f140c1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/30/us/politics/30trump-gop1/merlin_158088105_7010c627-6efb-4c2a-a0b5-ce97a2f140c1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/30/us/politics/30trump-gop1/merlin_158088105_7010c627-6efb-4c2a-a0b5-ce97a2f140c1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/30/us/politics/30