may be wondering how the race’s leading liberals differ. Or you may be a progressive voter trying to figure out whom to support. We’re here to help.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/07/30/us/politics/elizabeth-warren-bernie-sanders.html', 'snippet': 'You may be wondering how the race’s leading liberals differ. Or you may be a progressive voter trying to figure out whom to support. We’re here to help.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Senators Bernie Sanders of Vermont and Elizabeth Warren of Massachusetts, who will face off on the presidential debate stage for the first time on Tuesday, are often viewed as two sides of the same progressive coin: They are, after all, both liberal populists who want to fundamentally upend the current economic system to help working- and middle-class Americans. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/30/us/politics/30WARRENSANDERS1/merlin_156358848_78d8a038-c89c-4998-b13e-8ef569b516ec-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 401, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/07/30/us/politics/30WARRENSANDERS1/merlin_156358848_78d8a038-c89c-4998-b13e-8ef569b516ec-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 401}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/30/us/politics/30WARRENSANDERS1/merlin_156358848_78d8a038-c89c-4998-b13e-8ef569b516ec-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 684, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/30/us/politics/30WARRENSANDERS1/merlin_156358848_78d8a038-c89c-4998-b13e-8ef569b516ec-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type