out taking hormone therapy to block naturally elevated levels of testosterone.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Caster Semenya of South Africa, a two-time Olympic champion at 800 meters, will not be eligible to run her signature event at this year’s world track and field championships after the latest legal ruling in an ongoing, highly-charged case about testosterone levels and restrictions placed on intersex athletes to compete in certain women’s events.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/30/sports/30semenyaWEB1/merlin_158651607_7c562442-65d1-4091-88fd-46f9ee68bd21-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 429, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/07/30/sports/30semenyaWEB1/merlin_158651607_7c562442-65d1-4091-88fd-46f9ee68bd21-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 429}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/30/sports/30semenyaWEB1/merlin_158651607_7c562442-65d1-4091-88fd-46f9ee68bd21-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 733, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/30/sports/30semenyaWEB1/merlin_158651607_7c562442-65d1-4091-88fd-46f9ee68bd21-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1465, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/30/sports/30semenyaWEB1/merlin_158651607_7c562442-65d1-4091-88fd-46f9ee68bd21-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/07/30/sports/30semenyaWEB1/merlin_158651607_7c562442-65d1-4091-88fd-46f9ee68bd21-thumbStanda