ed Steinbeck Short Story Isn’t at All Like ‘Grapes of Wrath’', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Unearthed Steinbeck Story Is Seriously Amusing', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Steinbeck, John', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Manuscripts', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Strand Magazine', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Le Figaro (Newspaper)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Writing and Writers', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cats', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Paris (France)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Ransom, Harry, Center, The University of Texas at Austin', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-07-31T09:00:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Express', 'section_name': 'Books', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jacey Fortin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jacey', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fortin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9e9b649e-4b21-5bcc-811e-ea9717301461', 'word_count': 1017, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9e9b649e-4b21-5bcc-811e-ea9717301461'}, {'abstract': 'Because she rented the billboards, Kat Sullivan may face more than $40,000 in fines for not registering as a lobbyist.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/07/31/nyregion/lobbying-billboard-new-york.html', 'snippet': 'Because she rented the billboards, Kat Sullivan may face more than $40,000 in fines for not registering as a lobbyist.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When Kat Sullivan rented a billboard last year in upstate New York to call for stronger protections against child sex abusers, she believed she was engaging in the democratic process, using her own time and money to make her voice a