utshone the front-runners, Bernie Sanders and Elizabeth Warren.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/07/31/us/politics/who-won-democratic-debate.html', 'snippet': 'Lower-polling candidates had their moments, but none outshone the front-runners, Bernie Sanders and Elizabeth Warren.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Those hoping for an underdog candidate to run away with Tuesday night’s debate did not get their wish. The winners — at least in the initial assessment — were the night’s two front-runners, Senators Bernie Sanders and Elizabeth Warren. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/31/us/politics/31debatewinners/merlin_158670240_7c7d3298-9e57-4363-82f2-e72e79b574c1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/07/31/us/politics/31debatewinners/merlin_158670240_7c7d3298-9e57-4363-82f2-e72e79b574c1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/31/us/politics/31debatewinners/merlin_158670240_7c7d3298-9e57-4363-82f2-e72e79b574c1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/31/us/politics/31debatewinners/merlin_158670240_7c7d3298-9e57-4363-82f2-e72e79b574c1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/31/us/politics/31debatewinners/31debatewinners-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/07/31/us/politics/31debatewinners/31deb